---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Disclaimer | BRNDNUR Advisory LLP";
const description = "Legal and operational disclaimer for BRNDNUR Advisory LLP. Important notices regarding statutory authorities, independent decisions, and advisory scope.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/disclaimer/";
import { buildWhatsAppUrl } from '../../utils/whatsapp';

const closingWhatsAppUrl = buildWhatsAppUrl({
  "pageName": "Disclaimer Page",
  "sectionName": "Editorial Disclaimer CTA",
  "enquiryType": "Advisory Consultation",
  "topic": "I have reviewed the informational disclaimer on your website and would like to engage your team for formal advisory support.",
  "details": "My business requirement: [Please describe]",
  "callToAction": "Could you please advise on how to initiate a formal advisory engagement?"
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/disclaimer/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Editorial Hero -->
    <section class="hero" style="min-height: auto; padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px) 0 clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); text-align: center;">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal &amp; Compliance</p>
        <h1>Website &amp;&nbsp;Service <span>Disclaimer.</span></h1>
        <div class="gold-rule" style="margin: 16px auto 20px;"></div>
        <p class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 680px;">Important operational disclosures regarding our advisory role, government registries, and independent legal determinations.</p>
        
        <div class="trust-row" style="margin: 28px auto 0; justify-content: center; max-width: 640px;">
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">♢</span><span class="trust-label">Independent<br>Advisory Entity</span></div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">▱</span><span class="trust-label">Statutory Decision<br>Disclosure</span></div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">⌖</span><span class="trust-label">Skatt Business Park<br>Manjeri</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Disclaimer Content -->
    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
        <article class="legal-prose">
          <div class="values" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
            <div class="value">
              <span class="value-icon">♙</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Notice to Visitors</strong>
                <p>Please read this disclaimer before using our website or acting upon any educational content published herein.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="eyebrow">General Information</p>
          <h2>1. General Informational Purpose Only</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p>The materials, articles, class directories, and FAQs available on this website are prepared solely for general educational and informational purposes. They do not constitute formal legal counsel, tax advice, or certified statutory determinations. Users should obtain tailored professional advice before making commercial or intellectual property commitments.</p>

          <p class="eyebrow">Firm Identity</p>
          <h2>2. Non-Government Entity Notice</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p>BRNDNUR Advisory LLP is an independent business advisory and consultancy firm. We are <strong>not</strong> an official department, affiliate, or agency of the Government of India, the <a href="https://ipindia.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trade Marks Registry (CGPDTM)</a>, the <a href="https://www.mca.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA)</a>, the <a href="https://www.gst.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goods and Services Tax Network (GSTN)</a>, or the <a href="https://www.fssai.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI)</a>. Official portals for these departments can be accessed directly at their respective government domains.</p>

          <p class="eyebrow">Statutory Sovereignty</p>
          <h2>3. No Guarantee of Registration or Outcomes</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p>While our advisory team exercises professional diligence in clearance searching, class categorization, and documentation drafting, the final decision to accept, register, reject, or issue examination queries rests entirely with the competent statutory officers. BRNDNUR cannot and does not guarantee that a trademark application, GST registration, MSME filing, or FSSAI application will be approved without objection, opposition, or delay.</p>

          <p class="eyebrow">Advisory Limitations</p>
          <h2>4. Preliminary Searches Are Not Exhaustive</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p>Preliminary brand name and trademark clearance searches conducted via public registry tools are advisory screens. They cannot account for pending unregistered common-law rights, recent filings pending registry database indexing, or subjective adjudications made during examination and opposition proceedings.</p>

          <p class="eyebrow">External Resources</p>
          <h2>5. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p>This website may contain links to third-party or government websites for user convenience. BRNDNUR Advisory LLP does not control, endorse, or accept responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of external websites.</p>

          <p class="eyebrow">Editorial Standards</p>
          <h2>6. Editorial, Fact-Checking &amp; Corrections Policy</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p>Our educational guides, trademark class summaries, and business registration checklists are written by business advisory specialists, grounded in client case study analysis and first-hand advisory practice. As part of our editorial protocol, our legal team reviewed and fact-checked statutory procedures against current provisions of the Trade Marks Act 1999, CGPDTM examination manuals, and official gazettes. In our experience, regulatory requirements evolve; our expert advisors and senior editors regularly verify published materials to maintain factual accuracy. If you identify an item requiring correction or clarification, please notify our editorial desk at <a href="mailto:brndnuradvisoryllp@gmail.com">brndnuradvisoryllp@gmail.com</a> for prompt review.</p>

          <p class="eyebrow">Inquiries &amp; Notice</p>
          <h2>7. Contact Details</h2>
          <div class="gold-rule"></div>
          <p><strong>BRNDNUR Advisory LLP</strong><br />
          Skatt Business Park, Manjeri<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:brndnuradvisoryllp@gmail.com">brndnuradvisoryllp@gmail.com</a><br />
          Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+919048188899">+91 90481 88899</a></p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Signature Full-Width Dark Navy CTA Band (Harmonized with Homepage) -->
    <section class="cta-band">
      <img class="cta-leaves" src="/assets/cta-leaves.webp" alt="" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <div class="container cta-inner">
        <div class="cta-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Professional Advisory</p>
          <h2>Honest Guidance &amp;<br>Transparent Practice.</h2>
          <p>We provide objective legal appraisals and realistic expectations so you make informed brand decisions.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href={closingWhatsAppUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Consult on WhatsApp <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-benefits">
          <div class="cta-benefit">
            <span class="value-icon">☏</span>
            <div>
              <strong>No False Promises</strong>
              <p>Honest risk classification before non-refundable fees are incurred.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-benefit">
            <span class="value-icon">♢</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Statutory Separation</strong>
              <p>Official government e-receipts provided directly to you.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-benefit">
            <span class="value-icon">♧</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Local Accessibility</strong>
              <p>Senior advisory team accessible in Manjeri, Malappuram.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
